{id:"T008",statement:scalar,inputs:["H001","H002","H003","T004"],source_steps:["S014"],explanation:"Construct bar and the canonical prime-field map eps. Prove the two K-linear tensor equivalences with the declared forward/inverse formulas, using balancing and p=0. ModN is exactly the quotient by pMR. For each integer endomorphism, prove the naturality equations; construct its descended ZMod-linear quotient map with the stated quotient formula. This gives intertwining for x,y,h and every divided power without extra action premises."},
